    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109645" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπτι-ασμός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>laying oneself backwards,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Salt.</u>
				71
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>Im.</u>
				2.6
			</span></i> (pl.), Vett. Val.<i><span class="en">
				3.12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>lying supine,</i> of bedridden people, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Fract.</u>
				11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<i>sluggish appetite, aversion from food, nausea,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				8.378
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				13.140
			</span></i>.</div>
